AWS LAMDA:- 
       aws lamda is a serveless computing service that lets you run code without managing server
       lamda intigrates with s3 api gateway, sqs , sns, dynamodb etc
       secure & control via iam roles


USES OF LAMDA:- 
     1) run code without server
     2) automatic scaling
     3) event driven processing
     4) backend for web & mobile application
     5) data processing
     6) automatic task
     7) cost effective

EXAMPLE:- when a user upload an image to an s3 bucket , lamda can automatically resize the image & save the resized version


FEATURES OF LAMDA:- 
      1) serveless executions
      2) autoscaling
      3) pay per use
      4) support multiple language
      5) intregrate with aws service


DISADVANTAGE:-

      1) latency while starting
      2) limited control of infrastructure
      3) time limit
